        "created_at": "2018-11-14T15:25:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I enjoyed this episode, the Inverseiverse really is quite interesting. I guess it makes sense that there wouldn't be any actual team of 'Prime Wardens', what with the big egos most of the multiverse's villains seem to have.</p>\n<p>Though I think the Ennead fall under the umbrella of 'supervillain team'.</p>",
